7:#      S2  src > MTE_TLB_C                      (before the switch: every destination, fill or copy)
8:#      S3  mode & MTE_MODE_COPY                 (MTE_TLB_LIN_A / LIN_B only -- tiled COPY is implemented)
9:#      S4  depth != 8                           (linear only)
