The source audit found a whole-detector gap: after S5 declines a partial mask, no session checks that a legal linear fill still works. A guard that keeps refusing linear transfers once S5’s latch is set appears to leave all 68 rows green. I’m separating that gap from the repaired cells and the record corrections in the review.

